WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.131 --> 00:00:03.149
Your balance, account selector and activity shortcuts.

2
00:00:03.149 --> 00:00:06.205
Review monthly summaries, category spending and movement trends.

3
00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:10.254
Choose Pearl or Midnight in Appearance. Your choice is saved locally.

4
00:00:10.254 --> 00:00:12.794
Midnight updates the workspace and charts, not your data.

5
00:00:12.794 --> 00:00:15.846
Bank accounts: star to favorite, bin to request deletion.

6
00:00:15.846 --> 00:00:18.397
Banks: compact rows, clear headers and labelled operation icons.

7
00:00:18.397 --> 00:00:22.278
Expense types: category names, chart colors and visibility.

8
00:00:22.278 --> 00:00:25.369
Helpful field hints and a color picker. Cancel leaves data unchanged.

9
00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:29.051
Deletion asks first. Keep item is focused; nothing is deleted here.

10
00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:32.052
Back to Pearl. All figures shown are temporary offline demo data.
